What this repository does NOT contain
--------------------------------------
No RPG Maker XP RTP assets, no Enterbrain RGSS runtime DLLs, no proprietary
fonts, and no game content. mkxp is an independent, open-source reimplementation
of the RGSS interface — it uses none of Enterbrain's code.

"Bring your own game": you supply your own RMXP game files (see
docs/BRING-YOUR-OWN-GAME.md). You are solely responsible for the licensing and
rights of any game content you add. In particular, RPG Maker XP RTP assets are
proprietary (Enterbrain EULA) and Pokémon Essentials-based fan-games carry both
CC BY-NC-SA licensing and Nintendo/Creatures/GAME FREAK intellectual property —
do not redistribute such content through this engine.
